                                                "sense_id": "c8bbf858-c154-3a1f-8f00-461d4b8c6123",
                                                "text": "Being drunk , he remembers not a tit of life before the drink came well home. It is not that he sees the past mistily; he does not see at all. He lives then only in as much of the present as the word of his master for the time being[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
